gido.", "palavras": [[44.94, 45.32, "O", 1.0], [45.32, 45.62, "capital", 0.99], [45.62, 46.26, "segue", 1.0], [46.26, 46.9, "acima", 1.0], [46.9, 47.02, "do", 1.0], [47.02, 47.2, "mínimo", 1.0], [47.2, 47.66, "exigido.", 1.0]]}, {"ini": 47.76, "fim": 53.76, "texto": "E conta e poupança tem garantia do FGC, até 250 mil por CVF.", "palavras": [[47.76, 48.1, "E", 1.0], [48.1, 48.68, "conta", 1.0], [48.68, 49.68, "e", 0.84], [49.68, 50.5, "poupança", 1.0], [50.5, 50.72, "tem", 0.99], [50.72, 51.18, "garantia", 1.0], [51.18, 51.28, "do", 1.0], [51.28, 51.74, "FGC,", 1.0], [51.8, 52.2, "até", 1.0], [52.2, 52.9, "250", 0.5], [52.9, 53.26, "mil", 1.0], [53.26, 53.36, "por", 0.89], [53.36, 53.76, "CVF.", 0.69]]}, {"ini": 53.88, "fim": 55.52, "texto": "Manda para quem tem ação do Banco do Brasil.", "palavras": [[53.88, 54.3, "Manda", 1.0], [54.3, 54.4, "para", 0.88], [54.4, 54.54, "quem", 1.0], [54.54, 54.66, "tem", 1.0], [54.66, 54.94, "ação", 0.74], [54.94, 55.04, "do", 0.99], [55.04, 55.24, "Banco", 1.0], [55.24, 55.32, "do", 1.0], [55.32, 55.52, "Brasil.", 1.0]]}, {"ini": 55.52, "fim": 57.78, "texto": "Eu sou só o termômetro.", "palavras": [[55.52, 56.2, "Eu", 0.34], [56.2, 56.52, "sou", 1.0], [56.52, 56.82, "só", 1.0], [56.82, 57.2, "o", 1.0], [57.2, 57.78, "termômetro.", 1.0]]}]